## Code + Build lesson

The first implementation compile exposed one missing namespace close and was not accepted. Corrective commit `0340addf...` changed only that ownership boundary and the next compile passed 120/120. Connector-side source transformations must statically verify namespace opening/closing ownership before triggering the expensive build.

